{7}\\cdot 7{x}^{6} \\\\ &= {x}^{6}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503851 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01b9bd22-8b41-542b-82ba-62e400af4a02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{8}}{8} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503842} {:answer/id #uuid "0b7b7de0-eaf8-57d9-8475-c23f72194dd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8x^{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503844} {:answer/id #uuid "a5bb73e6-3ec8-51dd-ad3b-1cd6d6243b7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503862} {:answer/id #uuid "b52194ac-60ec-5ec7-91b2-c8a58426c3e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{8}}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503866} {:answer/id #uuid "f1d839d9-d182-5a2a-8ca4-8961f79ffaae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{8} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503874}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "01b9bd22-8b41-542b-82ba-62e400af4a02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{8}}{8} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503842} :answer-field/id #uuid "88eaa69f-9171-51b9-9926-45e937a2ad36" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503859}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4fc55d29-07c8-58f3-8bc8-d1223d0589d0" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int {x}^{7}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Include the arbitrary constant of integration." :question/worked-solution "We apply the power rule with $n=7$, and we get\n\n$$\n\\int {x}^{7}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{{x}^{7+1}}{7+1}+C=\\frac{{x}^{8}}{8}+C.\n$$\n\nLet's check by differentiating:\n\n$$\n\\begin{align