apply the power rule with $n=5$, and we get\n\n$$\n\\int {x}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{{x}^{5+1}}{5+1}+C=\\frac{{x}^{6}}{6}+C.\n$$\n\nLet's check by differentiating:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{6}+C) &= \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{6})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{6}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{6})+0 \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{6}\\cdot 6{x}^{5} \\\\ &= {x}^{5}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503860 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19401952-b969-5a9f-9750-1720c3ea9602" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{9}}{9} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503845} {:answer/id #uuid "3d942c43-21e5-5ec4-b609-785240316ce4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8x^{7} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503847} {:answer/id #uuid "7ff916ab-3641-575c-b8ab-d8ce83a4174b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{9} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503856} {:answer/id #uuid "90147ce6-5ad4-56fc-aa26-0fc98c813215" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{8}}{8} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503861} {:answer/id #uuid "ce201103-531a-5e28-bbe3-329fc7ec8063" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{7} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "19401952-b969-5a9f-9750-1720c3ea9602" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{9}}{9} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503845} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe44896c-83fc-509b-862e-d8c3138397c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503876}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8d476a50-5742-5b02-8acf-300d458d3177" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int {x}^{8}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the power rule with $n=8$, and we get\n\n$$\n\\int {x}^{8}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{{x}^{8+1}}{8+1}+C=\\frac{{x}^{9}}{9}+C.\n$$\n\nLet's check by differentiating:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{9}}{9}+C) &= \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{9}}{9})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{9}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{9})+0 \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{9}\\cdot 9{x}^{8} \\\\ &= {x}^{8}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503871 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "863bcfda-f86c-5454-b9dc-accc499f2c5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x^{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503858} {:answer/id #uuid "abbb6d1e-23ec-52ad-93a6-2a688bee49af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{4}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503864} {:answer/id #uuid "abe28291-ecd6-5f9e-985f-a0a2c28cc41d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{5}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503865} {:answer/id #uuid "e85650a9-47ba-50b3-a4f1-3c07d1371853" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503872} {:answer/id #uuid "f079c239-840f-54f7-96fe-bbb4346258a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x^{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503873}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "abbb6d1e-23ec-52ad-93a6-2a688bee49af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{4}}{4}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503864} :answer-field/id #uuid "a740068d-6348-515e-8b5f-4399bec063f0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503863}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e2fcd99b-3b51-589f-9fd0-4c5df6da6a6c" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the power rule with $n=3$, and we get\n\n$$\n\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{{x}^{3+1}}{3+1}+C=\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\nLet's check by differentiating:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}+C) &= \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{4}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{4})+0 \\\\ &= \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4{x}^{3} \\\\ &= {x}^{3}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503879 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d7829f8-6eb6-557a-9168-c1c357d9482c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{x}^{7/2}}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503878}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0d7829f8-6eb6-557a-9168-c1c357d9482c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2{x}^{7/2}}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503878} :answer-field/id #uuid "1dad12b4-53d9-5ebb-9ae6-bd1949a26915" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503881}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0f6eb79d-ca08-5993-aa8f-2308ed2df00b" :question/problem "Find the antiderivative of $\\sqrt[2]{{x}^{5}}.$\n\nWork on $x>0$.\n\nThe antiderivative is {{field-1}} $+C$. Enter only the term before $+C$, with no additive constant." :question/worked-solution "We start by writing the root as a rational power, $\\sqrt[2]{{x}^{5}}={x}^{5/2}.$ So, 